# 8. SCHOOL OFFICER MODE

School Officers should inspect the dossier using the same Student-facing presentation.

## Read-only Student content

The officer must not be able to:

- Edit Student declaration values.
- Add declarations on behalf of the Student.
- Delete Student declarations.
- Replace Student evidence.
- Change Student-uploaded files.
- Trigger Student submission actions.

All submitted content is read-only to the reviewer.

## School actions

The interface may provide the existing authorized:

- Preliminary criterion assessment.
- Evidence inspection.
- Review comments.
- Scoped supplementation request.
- Supplement response inspection.
- Reassessment after supplementation.
- School recommendation selection.

Use the actual established School review contract.

Do not add fictional case-resolution steps.

## Important School forwarding boundary

The School Officer may recommend applications during individual assessment.

However, the actual:

**"Chốt danh sách và chuyển Thành phố"**

operation is a separate batch workflow implemented in SRW-1 and exposed through SRW-3.

Do NOT place a separate "Chuyển Thành phố" action in each Student dossier.

Do NOT recreate individual School-to-City forwarding.

